  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3266\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6pLLiYf.png\"></a></p>\n<h2><strong>發光 TXF</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/emissive-txf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_428068_downloads.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252femissive-txf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?color=2d2d2d&colorA=17b85a&style=flat-square&label=&suffix= downloads&query=downloads&url=https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/izDZRaNR&logo=modrinth&logoColor=2d2d2d\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>發光材質涵蓋以下項目：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>礦石（鑽石、黃金、鐵、綠寶石、石英、紅石、地獄金、銅）</li>\n<li>方塊（鍍金黑石、附魔桌、釀造台）</li>\n<li>物品（釀造台、火把、靈魂火把、紅石火把）</li>\n<li>更多...</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.12.2 版本需要：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine 模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-future-texture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Future Texture (TXF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.16-1.21 版本需要：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine 模組</a>&nbsp;或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity 模組</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/411/561/2021-11-30_08.png\"></p>",
